#   segment_level_df  -- one row per segment
#   objrel_level_df   -- one row per objRel entry
#
# These stay in memory so you can slice them ad-hoc afterwards.
#
# SECTIONS
#   0. Load + build the three base frames
#   1. Table-level overview (volume, versions, policies)
#   2. plcyObjTypeCde -- null vs populated, at every grain
#   3. Distribution: country x policy_id x plcyObjTypeCde
#   4. sgmntTypeCde -- null vs populated, format breakdown
#   5. Relationship between the two code fields
#   6. Identifier format inventory (plcyObjId / cntlId)
#   7. Text field profile (policyText / policyPurpose / segment)
#   8. Export to Excel
# ============================================================

